{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895720/extras/8072bfbf2eede6f27f843485c66a72d7.avif?t=1754937963\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Black Tower Enigma</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Puzzle-Solving Game Boy Adventure about an Orc inside a Mysterious Tower looking for his Wife.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Wigo</strong>, the Orc, whose wife has been kidnapped and taken up to the skies by a magic dress gifted by a mysterious Fairy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Wigo saw his wife going up to the skies, he went to the tallest building known on the continent: The Black Tower Enigma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the <strong>Black Tower Enigma</strong>, Wigo has to solve some riddles and challenges in order to climb up and find some clues to find his wife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895720/extras/5f6297d6c43a9769f6a5bf6c9cd0d8c8.poster.avif?t=1754937963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895720/extras/5f6297d6c43a9769f6a5bf6c9cd0d8c8.mp4?t=1754937963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a small yet elaborate challenge that requires the player to use their intelligence and ability to decipher the riddles to advance through the Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, <strong>Black Tower Enigma</strong> has an interesting background story, which is enriched inside the huge library scattered throughout each level of the tower.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elaborated puzzles, riddles, and hints along each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting story discovered along each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool art-style designed both for Game Boy Color and Game Boy DMG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orchestral-designed music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895720/extras/032d3030d2c82fcc22c598140b64821a.avif?t=1754937963\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ogre Pixel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895720?t=1754937963","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895720?t=1754937963","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895720/4408afd3d82200605ad2ae36a065028e7000e7b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754937963","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895720/4408afd3d82200605ad2ae36a065028e7000e7b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754937963","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895720/extras/8072bfbf2eede6f27f843485c66a72d7.avif?t=1754937963\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Black Tower Enigma</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Puzzle-Solving Game Boy Adventure about an Orc inside a Mysterious Tower looking for his Wife.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Wigo</strong>, the Orc, whose wife has been kidnapped and taken up to the